  "instructions": [
    "Heat 2 tablespoons of vegetable oil in a wok or large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and minced garlic and stir-fry until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the chicken breast and cook until browned and cooked through.",
    "Add the fried rice to the wok and stir-fry for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add the soy sauce, fish sauce, salt, and pepper, and stir-fry for another minute.",
    "Transfer the Nasi Goreng to a serving platter and garnish with chopped green onions, if desired.",
    "Serve immediately."
